{"id": "3168487", "revid": "350739", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3168487", "title": "Baschet la Jocurile Olimpice de var\u0103 din 2024 - masculin 3x3", "text": "Turneul masculin de baschet 3x3 de la Jocurile Olimpice de var\u0103 din 2024 a avut loc \u00een perioada 30 iulie-5 august 2024 \u00een Place de la Concorde din Paris.\nArbitri.\nUrm\u0103torii arbitri au fost selecta\u021bi pentru a oficia la acest turneu.\nRezultate.\nFaza preliminar\u0103.\nClasament.\n\u00cen caz de egalitate de victorii s-au luat \u00een considerare meciurile directe. \u00cen cazul \u00een care egalitatea a persistat s-au luat \u00een considerare num\u0103rul de puncte marcate.\n&lt;section begin=Standings /&gt;&lt;section end=Standings /&gt;\nRezultate.\n&lt;section begin=P1 /&gt;&lt;section end=P1 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P2 /&gt;&lt;section end=P2 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P3 /&gt;&lt;section end=P3 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P4 /&gt;&lt;section end=P4 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P5 /&gt;&lt;section end=P5 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P6 /&gt;&lt;section end=P6 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P7 /&gt;&lt;section end=P7 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P8 /&gt;&lt;section end=P8 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P9 /&gt;&lt;section end=P9 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P10 /&gt;&lt;section end=P10 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P11 /&gt;&lt;section end=P11 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P12 /&gt;&lt;section end=P12 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P13 /&gt;&lt;section end=P13 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P14 /&gt;&lt;section end=P14 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P15 /&gt;&lt;section end=P15 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P16 /&gt;&lt;section end=P16 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P17 /&gt;&lt;section end=P17 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P18 /&gt;&lt;section end=P18 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P19 /&gt;&lt;section end=P19 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P20 /&gt;&lt;section end=P20 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P21 /&gt;&lt;section end=P21 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P22 /&gt;&lt;section end=P22 /&gt;\n&lt;section begin=P23 /&gt;&lt;section end=P23 /&gt;\n&lt;section b